                        "entry_id": "0ae086d6-6d08-3468-805f-1fd0fe222514",
                        "glosses": [
                            "A community in the district of Luojiang in the prefecture-level city of Quanzhou, Fujian, China, famed for a celebrated bridge."
                        ],
